# Cerberus Build Conventions

- This is the Cerberus monorepo. Read `CLAUDE.md` and `CONTRACT.md` before editing.
- NEVER edit `proto/`, `components/wit/`, `schemas/`, or `contract/`. They are frozen. Request changes instead.
- Stay ONLY in: `daemon/mesh`, `daemon/telemetry`, `daemon/supervisor`, `core/identity`.
- Build against `contract/go` types; stub other lanes via `contract/go/stub`. Don't call other lanes directly.
- Must pass `go build ./...`, `go test ./...`, `cargo build`, `cargo test` before claiming done. Add ≥1 test per vertical.
- Frontier features (zk-WASM, RDMA, host-TEE) stay documented stubs.
